  { q: 'Can I extract pages in a different order?', a: 'Yes! Click pages in any order you want. If you select page 5, then page 2, then page 8, the extracted PDF will have them in that order — 5, 2, 8.' },
  { q: 'Can I extract multiple pages at once?', a: 'Yes. Click as many page thumbnails as you need. You can select all pages with the "Select All" button, or click individual pages to toggle them on/off.' },
  { q: 'Will extracting pages affect the original PDF?', a: 'No. A completely new PDF is created containing only your selected pages. Your original file is never modified.' },
  { q: 'Is there a limit to how many pages I can extract?', a: 'No limit. You can extract all pages from a PDF if you want. The tool handles PDFs with hundreds of pages.' },
  { q: 'How do I preview what each page contains before extracting?', a: 'Each page is shown as a thumbnail preview in the grid. You can see what content is on each page before selecting it. Thumbnails are small, so text may not be readable — adjust your browser zoom if needed.' },
